CEA-608 closed captions

Parts of src/subs/cc/cea608.rs (the character tables, the cc_valid and parity checks, the
suppression of repeated control codes, the caption/Text/XDS service tracking and the mid-row
space), src/subs/cc/extract.rs (the A/53 SEI and user data walk) and src/subs/cc/reorder.rs (the
queue ordered by unique PTS that releases a late buffer at once), and the pop-on alignment in
src/subs/cc/ass.rs, are ported from androidx Media3, commit
9c1739438bf4ee07cecaed0302b632c5f5f55990:
https://github.com/androidx/media
(libraries/extractor/src/main/java/androidx/media3/extractor/text/cea/Cea608Decoder.java,
libraries/extractor/src/main/java/androidx/media3/extractor/CeaUtil.java,
libraries/extractor/src/main/java/androidx/media3/extractor/ts/UserDataReader.java,
libraries/container/src/main/java/androidx/media3/container/ReorderingBufferQueue.java)

